{"id":"bb3bb78c5caf074d","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-many-step-functional-strategy.md","title":"多步函数策略","display":"df-many-step-functional-strategy — 多步函数策略","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","type":"definition","label":"56-df-many-step-functional-strategy","aliases":["56-df-many-step-functional-strategy"],"display":"df-many-step-functional-strategy — 多步函数策略","depends_on":["[[56-df-reduction-strategy]]","[[56-df-relation-closure]]","[[56-df-normal-form]]"],"source_section":"§4.9 Definition 4.9.1(ii); §9.1 discussion following Exercise 9.1.3","source_printed_pages":"130,479","source_ocr_blocks":[151,500],"source_verification":"已据本地DjVu提取文本核对对应段落；本节点的独立论证与核验边界见Remark"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-many-step-functional-strategy"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-many-step-functional-strategy</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-many-step-functional-strategy — 多步函数策略"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1ac2af2b5f2884da\" href=\"?note=1ac2af2b5f2884da\" title=\"56-df-reduction-strategy\">56-df-reduction-strategy</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9ddd157960e9574a\" href=\"?note=9ddd157960e9574a\" title=\"56-df-relation-closure\">56-df-relation-closure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e295b2b3159f2b40\" href=\"?note=e295b2b3159f2b40\" title=\"56-df-normal-form\">56-df-normal-form</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§4.9 Definition 4.9.1(ii); §9.1 discussion following Exercise 9.1.3"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"130,479"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>151</span><span>500</span></div>"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"已据本地DjVu提取文本核对对应段落；本节点的独立论证与核验边界见Remark"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 为集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\to\\subseteq A^2\">\\(\\to\\subseteq A^2\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\\in A^A\">\\(F\\in A^A\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NF}\">\\(\\mathrm{NF}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e295b2b3159f2b40\" href=\"?note=e295b2b3159f2b40\" title=\"56-df-normal-form\">56-df-normal-form</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\to^+\">\\(\\to^+\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"9ddd157960e9574a\" href=\"?note=9ddd157960e9574a\" title=\"56-df-relation-closure\">56-df-relation-closure</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ReductionStrategy}\">\\(\\mathrm{ReductionStrategy}\\)</span> 及函数迭代 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F^{[n]}\">\\(F^{[n]}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"1ac2af2b5f2884da\" href=\"?note=1ac2af2b5f2884da\" title=\"56-df-reduction-strategy\">56-df-reduction-strategy</a>。</li>\n<li>以下定义集合论函数策略的结构性质；计算性未作为本形式语言的谓词。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ManyStepReductionStrategy}(A,\\to,F)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\forall a\\in A\\;\\bigl((\\mathrm{NF}(A,\\to,a)\\Longrightarrow F(a)=a)\n\\land(\\neg\\mathrm{NF}(A,\\to,a)\\Longrightarrow a\\to^+F(a))\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ManyStepReductionStrategy}(A,\\to,F)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\forall a\\in A\\;\\bigl((\\mathrm{NF}(A,\\to,a)\\Longrightarrow F(a)=a)\n\\land(\\neg\\mathrm{NF}(A,\\to,a)\\Longrightarrow a\\to^+F(a))\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FunctionalReductionStrategy}(A,\\to,F)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\mathrm{ReductionStrategy}(A,\\to,F)\\lor\n\\mathrm{ManyStepReductionStrategy}(A,\\to,F).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{FunctionalReductionStrategy}(A,\\to,F)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\mathrm{ReductionStrategy}(A,\\to,F)\\lor\n\\mathrm{ManyStepReductionStrategy}(A,\\to,F).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>多步策略在非正规形处必须给出非空有限归约，不能只要求自反传递闭包；否则恒等函数会错误地成为任意系统的多步策略。一步策略是多步策略的特例。正规形处保留恒等值只是函数的停机约定，不把该恒等值算作原关系中的一步。原书另要求计算性；此处沿用56既有集合论函数接口，不声称任意满足该谓词的函数都有可执行程序。</p>\n<p>来源的OCR页块序号按本地提取文本中的分页符编号，不等同于DjVu物理页码。本轮未作机器证明；计算性未编码。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-reduction-strategy","status":"resolved","id":"1ac2af2b5f2884da","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-reduction-strategy]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-relation-closure","status":"resolved","id":"9ddd157960e9574a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-relation-closure]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-normal-form","status":"resolved","id":"e295b2b3159f2b40","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-normal-form]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-normal-form","status":"resolved","id":"e295b2b3159f2b40","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{NF}$ 见 [[56-df-normal-form]]，$\\to^+$ 见 [[56-df-relation-closure]]；$\\mathrm{ReductionStrategy}$ 及函数迭代 $F^{[n]}$ 见 [[56-df-reduction-strategy]]。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-relation-closure","status":"resolved","id":"9ddd157960e9574a","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{NF}$ 见 [[56-df-normal-form]]，$\\to^+$ 见 [[56-df-relation-closure]]；$\\mathrm{ReductionStrategy}$ 及函数迭代 $F^{[n]}$ 见 [[56-df-reduction-strategy]]。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-reduction-strategy","status":"resolved","id":"1ac2af2b5f2884da","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{NF}$ 见 [[56-df-normal-form]]，$\\to^+$ 见 [[56-df-relation-closure]]；$\\mathrm{ReductionStrategy}$ 及函数迭代 $F^{[n]}$ 见 [[56-df-reduction-strategy]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\to\\subseteq A^2","display":false},{"tex":"F\\in A^A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NF}","display":false},{"tex":"\\to^+","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ReductionStrategy}","display":false},{"tex":"F^{[n]}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ManyStepReductionStrategy}(A,\\to,F)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\forall a\\in A\\;\\bigl((\\mathrm{NF}(A,\\to,a)\\Longrightarrow F(a)=a)\n\\land(\\neg\\mathrm{NF}(A,\\to,a)\\Longrightarrow a\\to^+F(a))\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FunctionalReductionStrategy}(A,\\to,F)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\mathrm{ReductionStrategy}(A,\\to,F)\\lor\n\\mathrm{ManyStepReductionStrategy}(A,\\to,F).","display":true}],"bytes":2024,"backlinks":[{"id":"e22d9797b2ac34d5","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FunctionalReductionStrategy}$ 与 $F^{[n]}$ 见 [[56-df-many-step-functional-strategy]]；$\\to^*$ 见 [[56-df-relation-closure]]。"},{"id":"9e7e983eeefce662","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ManyStepReductionStrategy}$、$\\mathrm{FunctionalReductionStrategy}$ 及 $F^{[n]}$ 见 [[56-df-many-step-functional-strategy]]。"},{"id":"7c98a5e0a5533d5f","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FunctionalReductionStrategy}$ 见 [[56-df-many-step-functional-strategy]]；$\\mathrm{SNAt}(A,\\to,a)$ 见 [[56-df-strongly-normalizing]]。"},{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-183","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-df-many-step-functional-strategy.md]]"}],"outgoing":["1ac2af2b5f2884da","9ddd157960e9574a","e295b2b3159f2b40"]}